- **RQ-04** did not promote to P0 — the hinge quote renders verbatim at The Federalist.
- **P1-05** turned up the best incidental find: Daily Stoic sells a ten-day course on controlling your temper. That's the concrete exhibit the critic wanted, sitting one paragraph from the week he lost his.

**All 12 protected hits verified intact**, "Two Sides" diffed byte-for-byte against the frozen snapshot.

